00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:05.830
that means the mole is still
in the box and you lose.

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:17.480
Now can the mole please step forward

00:10:17.480 --> 00:10:22.103
and reveal themselves in 3, 2, 1.

00:10:25.396 --> 00:10:27.860
- I knew it, y'all
shouldn't have voted for me.

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:31.010
- Sasha was like the tallest
one there and she was great,

00:10:31.010 --> 00:10:32.710
and she had a great walk,
and she looks awesome.

00:10:32.710 --> 00:10:35.080
So she would've been either my last

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:36.560
or my second to last pick.

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:38.640
- I think my height saved me honestly.

00:10:38.640 --> 00:10:39.900
There is that still, like,

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:42.680
the preconceived notion of
what a model looks like.

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:45.560
And I think that this
episode really emphasizes

00:10:45.560 --> 00:10:47.310
that we do have a long way to go.

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:49.600
- I definitely believe
that she could model

00:10:49.600 --> 00:10:51.860
but the walk was a little off for me.

00:10:51.860 --> 00:10:54.230
- I didn't believe that you were the mole,

00:10:54.230 --> 00:10:56.040
solely because I actually
believe in people.

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:59.120
So to, I think conflate the,

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:01.710
like doing it because of your
loved one that's incarcerated

00:11:01.710 --> 00:11:02.850
is extremely offensive.

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:04.170
And so that was something

00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:07.140
that I just wouldn't have
stooped as low as to do.

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:10.400
And so that's, wow.

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:12.730
- I do really have a loved
one who's incarcerated.

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:14.650
I don't do runway, but like I,

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:16.230
and I'm sorry that you felt that way.

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:17.760
'Cause I didn't think like
that, 'cause it was like

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:19.970
in my mind that's still
so true to my story

00:11:19.970 --> 00:11:21.070
and like of who I am.

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:24.470
And like I do send photos
to my dad, you know,

00:11:24.470 --> 00:11:25.470
and keep him up to date.

00:11:25.470 --> 00:11:27.600
I just have never been on a runway.

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:29.950
- That's not her story,
it's her father's story.

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:32.700
And so the way that we share
about incarcerated people

00:11:32.700 --> 00:11:34.740
has to be considered.

00:11:34.740 --> 00:11:37.380
- I do take photos.

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:38.770
I love doing photo shoots.

00:11:38.770 --> 00:11:41.020
I've never been paid for a gig before.

00:11:41.020 --> 00:11:44.340
Like I kind of just do
it because I find it fun.

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:46.860
And I found that as I take photos,

00:11:46.860 --> 00:11:49.210
like I'm able to share
them with my loved one.

00:11:49.210 --> 00:11:52.460
And it's been kind of like
our fun way of communicating,

00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:53.293
you know?

00:11:53.293 --> 00:11:54.780
And he's getting a glimpse
of the outside world

00:11:54.780 --> 00:11:56.420
and he's seeing what I'm working on.

00:11:56.420 --> 00:11:57.900
So like that is very true

00:11:57.900 --> 00:12:00.840
and it wasn't like a made-up story at all.

00:12:00.840 --> 00:12:03.980
The only thing was, is just I'm
not a runway model, I guess.

00:12:03.980 --> 00:12:05.150
- [Narrator] How does it feel to win?

00:12:05.150 --> 00:12:05.983
- It feels great.

00:12:05.983 --> 00:12:07.610
I'm still in shock, honestly.

00:12:07.610 --> 00:12:09.280
- What's the most common
questions someone asks you

00:12:09.280 --> 00:12:11.229
when they learn you're a triplet?

00:12:11.229 --> 00:12:12.551
- [Dark Haired Triplets] Dick size.

00:12:12.551 --> 00:12:13.556
- Are you serious?

00:12:13.556 --> 00:12:15.823
- [Dark Haired Triplets] All the time.

00:12:15.823 --> 00:12:16.798
- We are triplets.

00:12:16.798 --> 00:12:17.887
- We are triplets.

00:12:17.887 --> 00:12:19.120
- We are triplets.

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:20.199
- We are triplets

00:12:20.199 --> 00:12:21.287
- We are triplets.

00:12:21.287 --> 00:12:22.576
- We are triplets.

00:12:22.576 --> 00:12:26.775
- I feel bad now, though.
Like I feel so bad.

00:12:26.775 --> 00:12:29.358
(techno music)

